<view class="page theme-{{theme}} feedback-page">
  <view class="page-top">
    <view class="h1">产品建议</view>
    <view class="muted small mt-8">你的建议会帮助练记变得更好。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card mt-24">
    <view class="section-title">建议类型</view>
    <view class="chip-row mt-12">
      <view wx:for="{{categories}}" wx:key="*this" class="chip {{category === item ? 'active' : ''}}" data-value="{{item}}" bindtap="selectCategory">{{item}}</view>
    </view>

    <view class="field mt-24">
      <view class="row between">
        <view class="field-label">建议内容</view>
        <view class="tiny muted">{{contentLength}} / 1000</view>
      </view>
      <textarea class="textarea feedback-textarea" maxlength="1000" placeholder="请描述你希望增加的功能、遇到的问题或使用感受..." placeholder-class="input-placeholder" value="{{content}}" bindinput="onContentInput" />
    </view>

    <view class="field mt-20">
      <view class="field-label">联系方式（选填）</view>
      <input class="input" maxlength="100" placeholder="微信号或邮箱，方便我们联系你" placeholder-class="input-placeholder" value="{{contact}}" bindinput="onContactInput" />
    </view>

    <view class="feedback-note mt-16">
      反馈会关联当前微信身份和昵称，仅用于查看问题和回访，不会公开展示。
    </view>

    <button class="btn btn-primary btn-block mt-24" loading="{{submitting}}" disabled="{{submitting}}" bindtap="submitFeedback">提交建议</button>
  </view>
</view>
